{"id": "EUVD-2026-78634", "enisaUuid": "e0c0f8cc-94fc-333a-a467-8ba80ccd0095", "description": "FreeRDP versions before 3.31.0 fail to validate MonitorIds array values when parsing RDP connection files, allowing unbounded array indexing in xf_detect_monitors. Attackers can craft a malicious RDP file with an out-of-range selectedmonitors value to trigger out-of-bounds heap read and write operations when opened in xfreerdp.", "datePublished": "2026-09-15T15:18:13", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-15T15:59:22", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/FreeRDP/FreeRDP/security/advisories/GHSA-23pf-q83q-x45r", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/freerdp-3.11.0-through-3.30.0-heap-buffer-overflow-via-monitor-index"], "aliases": ["GHSA-qjqr-mv8g-x357", "CVE-2026-91958"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4d5699eb-f724-3066-a7bc-bceb183956a1", "product": {"name": "FreeRDP", "vendor": {"name": "FreeRDP"}}, "product_version": "3.11.0 <3.31.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "98f16b12-7762-3a04-aa5e-0b7fffa65faf", "vendor": {"name": "FreeRDP"}}], "isExploited": false}